{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> is a 2D automation and strategy game set in a world where humanity has rendered the planet uninhabitable. You are the last remaining person, tasked with restoring nature and rebuilding life from a single surviving seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras/bb7413be30cf8ab6553bfc2a18ebb39a.avif?t=1773180984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras_big/bb7413be30cf8ab6553bfc2a18ebb39a.webp?t=1773180984 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is poisoned, resources are scarce, and the environment is hostile. Your mission is to establish production chains, reclaim the ecosystem, and make the world livable again. But not everything in nature welcomes your intervention \u2014 some creatures will see your efforts as a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and process resources to build automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create evolving production lines to optimize efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage humidity, temperature, and environmental conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to sustain life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face resistance from a changing and reactive ecosystem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras/0857f75f1bc71fe46d2ea65f1d703935.avif?t=1773180984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras_big/0857f75f1bc71fe46d2ea65f1d703935.webp?t=1773180984 width=1560 height=858 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> blends strategy, exploration, and environmental storytelling into an atmospheric gameplay experience. Every decision you make could shape the fate of a dying world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822770?t=1773180984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822770?t=1773180984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/15826c67371b9e76367bafba22d6c3fe93fdc78b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773180984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/15826c67371b9e76367bafba22d6c3fe93fdc78b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773180984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> is a 2D automation and strategy game set in a world where humanity has rendered the planet uninhabitable. You are the last remaining person, tasked with restoring nature and rebuilding life from a single surviving seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras/bb7413be30cf8ab6553bfc2a18ebb39a.avif?t=1773180984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras_big/bb7413be30cf8ab6553bfc2a18ebb39a.webp?t=1773180984 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is poisoned, resources are scarce, and the environment is hostile. Your mission is to establish production chains, reclaim the ecosystem, and make the world livable again. But not everything in nature welcomes your intervention \u2014 some creatures will see your efforts as a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and process resources to build automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create evolving production lines to optimize efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage humidity, temperature, and environmental conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to sustain life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face resistance from a changing and reactive ecosystem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras/0857f75f1bc71fe46d2ea65f1d703935.avif?t=1773180984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/extras_big/0857f75f1bc71fe46d2ea65f1d703935.webp?t=1773180984 width=1560 height=858 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> blends strategy, exploration, and environmental storytelling into an atmospheric gameplay experience. Every decision you make could shape the fate of a dying world.</p>","developers":["YebStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822770/1c0a5d945f612e2c7019ab8afff56c5b7c9a9bde/header.jpg?t=1773180984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3822770/1776078266/a27463e3f8b8f90fd57e1deec5c8b48f623d2f90/1772492880/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772494172","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams